  "details": "The taxiing ability on the plane script i made uses gameObject.transform.Rotate to rotate them while they are on the ground. There seems to be around a 50% chance that a plane will have a 'judder' to it while taxiing.\nI assume this is because, while stability of stations on rigidbodies was fixed, gameObject.transform.Rotate can still update an objects position after the local player's position (doesn't always), resulting in the vehicle's rotation being one frame ahead of your avatar.\nCan be seen easiest on Aircraft Carrier Jets\nwrld_0679be89-ab9d-46c3-b5f5-b7ed05a78022\n(press Q and E after entering the front seat of a plane.)",
